  "hero_summary_zh": "敌之尖刀，我之伤药，亚巴顿无论受到何种袭击都能幸免于难。他随时准备奔入焦灼的战场中盾护盟友，向敌友释放疗己或伤人的缠绕。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Able to transform enemy attacks into self-healing, Abaddon can survive almost any assault. Shielding allies and launching his double-edged coil at a friend or foe, he is always ready to ride into the thick of battle.",
