    {
      "name": "abaddon_aphotic_shield",
      "id": 5586,
      "name_zh": "无光之盾",
      "name_en": "Aphotic Shield",
      "description_zh": "召唤黑暗能量环绕友方单位，驱散他们并创造一个全伤害护盾，护盾在消失前能吸收一定量的伤害。护盾消失或被摧毁后将会爆炸，对附近区域的单位造成伤害，伤害值为护盾的最大吸收量。\n\n驱散类型：强驱散",
      "description_en": "Summons dark energies around an ally unit, dispelling them and creating an all damage barrier that absorbs a set amount of damage before expiring. When the barrier is destroyed it will burst and deal damage equal to the amount it could absorb to an area around it.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel",
      "notes_zh": [
        "不论护盾因持续时间结束或吸收足够伤害后被摧毁都将造成最大伤害。",
        "爆炸将不会对战争迷雾内单位造成伤害。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "The max damage is always dealt whether the barrier is destroyed by expiring or absorbing damage.",
        "The explosion does not damage units hidden by the fog of war."
      ],
      "source_collection": "abilities",
      "source_pointer": "/result/data/heroes/0/abilities/1",
      "innate": false,
      "granted_by_scepter": false,
      "granted_by_shard": false,
